21718::$$$message_0168_0000_0000$$$::There is a familiar face at the port.[lr]::
21719::$$$message_0168_0000_0001$$$::While Lancer can show up anywhere, he's actually a regular with his hobbies in the afternoon like this.[lr]::
21720::$$$message_0168_0000_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Now, how should I call out to him?[font italic=false]::
921718::$$$message_9168_0000_0000$$$::There is a familiar face at the port.[r]::

